        <mxCell id="c159" value="&lt;b&gt;Event katalog yang muncul, berurutan&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;run_started → token (narasi orchestrator) → per worker: worker_started → tool_call_started / tool_call_finished → worker_finished → tool_call_started submit_report → approval_required → (setelah keputusan) tool_call_finished submit_report → done atau error.&lt;br&gt;Job deteksi pola tidak memancarkan step_started; finish_worker tidak dilaporkan sebagai tool call." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
